<title>UK: World Bank adds 200 bln lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank adds 200 bln lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was increased by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiana SpA, J.P. Morgan and Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *200 BLN LIRE  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    06.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE  ZERO-COUPON    ISS PRICE  49.525    PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 05.DEC.95 AND NOW TOTALS</p>
<p>		1.0 TRILLION.</p>
<p>		ALL OTHER TERMS REMAIN THE SAME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
